{"id":"reference/Comments","kind":"langref","title":"注释","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Comments","file":"reference/Comments.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Comments","text":"注释"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Doc-Comments","text":"文档注释"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Top-Level-Doc-Comments","text":"顶层文档注释"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Comments\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Comments/#Comments\">注释</a></h2>\n\n      <p>注释分为三类。普通注释会被忽略，而<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Comments/#Doc-Comments\">文档注释</a>和<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Comments/#Top-Level-Doc-Comments\">顶层文档注释</a>用于让编译器生成包文档。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">comments.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> print = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).debug.print;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// Zig 中的注释以 \"//\" 开头，在下一个 LF 字节（行尾）处结束。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 下一行是一条注释，不会执行。</span>\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">//print(\"Hello?\", .{});</span>\n\n    print(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"Hello, world!\\n\"</span>, .{}); <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 另一条注释</span>\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-exe comments.zig</kbd>\n$ <kbd>./comments</kbd>\nHello, world!\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>Zig 没有多行注释。其每一行代码都可以独立进行词法分析。</p>\n      <h3 id=\"Doc-Comments\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Comments/#Doc-Comments\">文档注释</a></h3>\n\n      <p>文档注释恰好以三个斜杠开头，即 <code><span class=\"tok-comment\">///</span></code> 而非 <code><span class=\"tok-comment\">////</span></code>；连续多行文档注释会合并为一条多行文档注释。文档注释说明紧随其后的内容。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">doc_comments.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 用于存储纳秒精度时间戳的结构体（这是一条</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 多行文档注释）。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> Timestamp = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 自纪元起经过的秒数（这也是文档注释）。</span>\n    seconds: <span class=\"tok-type\">i64</span>, <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 使用有符号类型，以表示 1970 年之前的时间（不是文档注释）</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 当前秒内经过的纳秒数（又是一条文档注释）。</span>\n    nanos: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 返回表示 Unix 纪元的 `Timestamp` 结构体；即</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 1970 年 1 月 1 日 00:00:00 UTC 这一时刻（这也是文档注释）。</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">unixEpoch</span>() Timestamp {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> Timestamp{\n            .seconds = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>,\n            .nanos = <span class=\"tok-number\">0</span>,\n        };\n    }\n};</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>文档注释只允许出现在特定位置。如果出现在意料之外的位置，例如表达式中间或普通注释之前，就会产生编译错误。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">invalid_doc-comment.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 文档注释</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">//! 顶层文档注释</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> std = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>);</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-obj invalid_doc-comment.zig</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/invalid_doc-comment.zig:1:16: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">expected type expression, found 'a document comment'\n</span>/// doc-comment\n               <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">unattached_doc-comment.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">main</span>() <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 文件结束</span></code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig build-obj unattached_doc-comment.zig</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/unattached_doc-comment.zig:3:1: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">unattached documentation comment\n</span>/// End of file\n<span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>文档注释可以与普通注释交错排列；其中的普通注释会被忽略。</p>\n      \n      <h3 id=\"Top-Level-Doc-Comments\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Comments/#Top-Level-Doc-Comments\">顶层文档注释</a></h3>\n\n      <p>顶层文档注释以两个斜杠和一个感叹号开头，即 <code><span class=\"tok-comment\">//!</span></code>；它说明的是包含该注释的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Namespace/#Namespace\">命名空间</a>所属的类型。</p>\n      <p>顶层文档注释必须位于命名空间的起始处、所有表达式之前，否则会产生编译错误。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">tldoc_comments.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">//! 提供获取当前日期和时间的函数，支持不同的</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">//! 精细程度与准确程度。</span>\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> S = <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">//! 除文件创建的隐式结构体之外，其他命名空间中也</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">//! 允许顶层注释，但这并不十分有用。目前，</span>\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">//! 生成包文档时会忽略这些注释。</span>\n};</code></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      \n\n      ","translation":{"total":32,"translated":32}}
